     A* 07/06/07 C:02  Project: DR214A                               *
     A*               -USE DRFL14 for Citrix and/or GO4 flag         *
     A*                 * "G" - GO4 is Being used                    *
     A*                 * "C" - Citrix is in use                     *
     A*                 * "B" - Both Citrix and GO4 are in use       *
     A*                 if yes "Y", then We're using Citrix or "GO4" *
     A*                 so we will not use the REAL IP address, we'll*
     A*                 use 127.0.0.1 always.
     A*                                                              *
     A* 08/08/06 C:33  Project: DR214                                *
     A*               -Add new fields for iDarts                     *
     A*                 DRSDTQ - iDarts send DTAQ                    *
     A*                 DRRDTQ - iDarts return DTAQ                  *
