     A            DRFL01    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('IMAGE ENABLED-Y/N')
     A*** DRFL01 Usage - Image Enabled (Y/N or blank)
     A* PGM ID    SCRN#     Value     Indicator    Description
     A* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* SC010R    ALL        Y        *IN99 = 1    Image product is installed
     A*                      -        *IN99 = 0    Image product NOT installed
     A* SC012R    SCR01      Y        *IN99 = 1    Image product is installed
     A*                      -        *IN99 = 0    Image product NOT installed
     A* SC014R    SCR01      Y        *IN99 = 1    Image product is installed
     A*                      -        *IN99 = 0    Image product NOT installed
     A* SC015R    SCR01      Y        *IN99 = 1    Image product is installed
     A*                      -        *IN99 = 0    Image product NOT installed
     A*************************************************************************
