     A                                      TEXT('SUMMARY REF CODE USED Y/BLK')
     A*** DRFL02 Usage - Summary Code Option installed (Y/N or blank)
     A* PGM ID    SCRN#     Value     Indicator    Description
     A* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* SC010R   SCR02       Y        *IN36 = 1    Summary Code Opt displayed
     A*          SCR03       -        *IN36 = 0    Sum Code Opt NOT displayed
     A*          SCR06
     A* SC080R   SCR01       Y        *IN91 = 0    Summary Code Opt displayed
     A*                      -        *IN91 = 1    Sum Code Opt NOT displayed
     A* SC580R   SCR01       Y        *IN91 = 0    Summary Code Opt displayed
     A*                      -        *IN91 = 1    Sum Code Opt NOT displayed
