     A*                      -        *IN34 = 0    Data Entry Pgm NOT installed
     A* SC015R   SCR01       Y        *IN71 = 1    Data Entry Pgm Opt installed
     A*                      -        *IN71 = 0    Data Entry Pgm NOT installed
     A* SC080R   SCR01       Y        *IN93 = 0    Data Entry Pgm Opt displayed
     A*                      -        *IN93 = 1    Data Entry Pgm NOT displayed
