     A            DRFL06    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('MICROSOFT PRODUCTS')
      *      DRFL07 IF SET TO 'Y', INDICATES THAT EMAIL IS
      *                 INSTALLED (VISDARTS)
     A            DRFL07    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('EMAIL INSTALLED ')
     A*   IF SET TO 'Y' WILL ALLOW CHANGE OF DIARY TYPE FLAG
     A*   IN SC010R (DRFL08)
