     A* -----------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* SC010R   ALL       CL Pgm     OFCPGM    Used in F1=OV/400 to call the
     A*                     Name                CL program that loads Ofc Vision
     A* SC012R   SCR01     CL Pgm     OFCPGM    Used in F1=OV/400 to call the
     A*                     Name                CL program that loads Ofc Vision
     A* SC014R   SCR01     CL Pgm     OFCPGM    Used in F1=OV/400 to call the
     A*                     Name                CL program that loads Ofc Vision
     A* SC015R   SCR01     CL Pgm     OFCPGM    Used in F1=OV/400 to call the
     A*                     Name                CL program that loads Ofc Vision
     A*************************************************************************
